OL,3,CBoxing world champion Joe Cordina
OL,4,Cpleads not guilty to two charges of
OL,5,Cassault
OL,7,FFormer boxing world champion Joe
OL,8,FCordina has denied assaulting another
OL,9,Fman.
OL,11,FCordina, 34, a two-time IBF super-
OL,12,Ffeatherweight champion, appeared at
OL,13,FCardiff Magistrates' Court on Tuesday
OL,14,Fand pleaded not guilty to two charges
OL,15,Fof assault by beating.
OL,17,FSouth Wales Police previously said the
OL,18,Fcharges relate to an incident outside
OL,19,FPentwyn Service Station in Cardiff on
OL,20,FFebruary 27 this year.
