OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785251895
OL,3,CBoxing world champion Joe Cordina
OL,4,Cpleads not guilty to two charges of
OL,5,Cassault
OL,7,FDuring the brief hearing, Cordina
OL,8,Fappeared in the dock alongside Jamie
OL,9,FO'Brien, 32, from Pentwyn, who has
OL,10,Falso been charged with assault in
OL,11,Fconnection with the incident.
OL,13,FThe court previously heard the
OL,14,Foffences the two men are charged with
OL,15,Fare alleged to be "against each other".
OL,17,FOn Tuesday, Nadeem Majid, representing
OL,18,FCordina, said the second charge of
OL,19,Fassault he faces "emanates from one
OL,20,Fcontinued incident".
