OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F432A1785251895
OL,3,CBoxing world champion Joe Cordina
OL,4,Cpleads not guilty to two charges of
OL,5,Cassault
OL,7,FO'Brien did not enter a plea during
OL,8,Fthe hearing.
OL,10,FDistrict Judge Charlotte Murphy set a
OL,11,Ftrial date for Cordina of October 13.
OL,13,FShe said: "You've pleaded not guilty
OL,14,Fto two offences, which means there's
OL,15,Fgoing to be a trial.
OL,17,F"Until then, I grant you unconditional
OL,18,Fbail."
